 "76561197990205966", "personaname": "Pocketstealer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pocketstealer/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 7467, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4594, "last_played": 1787675557, "avatar": "bccf9bd7e7ef694f0fa36b864e07dd7449610beb"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is now \"Rust with pets\" but worse Rust and worse pets.\r\nThe whole sphere mechanic is gutted and now it's \"throw to capture, Good job now it sucks since you can't throw it to fight it just spawns near you\".\r\n\r\nSo taking away the \"throw Pal mechanic\" now this is not possible:\r\n1) Make the pet your tank. Nope\r\n2) Take the pal from dangerous situation and throw it back in? Nope\r\n3) You shoot first, Pal reposition in whatever maybe it gets hit 3 times till it starts to hit back\r\n4) You are behind a tree and summon a Pal? Guess what it will not attack\r\n5) Sometimes the Pal summons inside a tree, rock or the ground\r\n\r\nNow, it sucks. I have no reason to play it since the main jist was Pals. If there is no mechanic around them other than \"it's a tank sometimes\" i am not gonna bother.\r\n\r\nFor me is a clear loss. \r\n\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1734998109, "timestamp_updated": 1734998109, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.415384620428085327", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 2}]}, {"recommendationid": "183523183", "author": {"steamid": "76561198304007605", "personaname": "Duncan Jones", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/duncanjones/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 11953, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5090, "last_played": 17